atlas-pro, pellet-2\n- extract: corvid-mini, atlas-lite\n- prose: pellet-2, atlas-lite\n\nR1: model eligible only if lane in its lanes column (implicit in lane order).\nR2: for review lane, model's family must differ from request's author_family.\nR3: pinned cli — only models on that cli eligible.\nR4: skip unavailable models.\nR5: no eligible model → \"Unrouted\", effort null.\nR6: effort clamping: below floor → floor; above ceiling → ceiling; otherwise keep. Effort never affects eligibility.\n\nEffort scale: low < medium < high < max.\n\nq1: lane implement, effort medium. Lane order: atlas-pro, corvid-9. atlas-pro: lanes include implement. No pinned cli, no unavailable, not review (R2 n/a). So atlas-pro wins. Effort: medium below floor high → use floor = high. Answer: {\"id\": \"q1\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"}.\n\nq2: lane review, effort high, author_family Corvid. Lane order: corvid-9, atlas-pro. corvid-9 family Corvid == author_family Corvid → R2 makes ineligible. Next: atlas-pro (Northwind ≠ Corvid, review in lanes) → eligible. Effort high: atlas-pro floor high, ceiling max. high within [high, max] → keep high. Answer: {\"id\": \"q2\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"}.\n\nq3: lane extract, effort low, pinned_cli pl. Lane order: corvid-mini (cv — not pl → ineligible by R3), atlas-lite (nw — not pl → ineligible). No eligible → Unrouted, effort null. Answer: {\"id\": \"q3\", \"model\": \"Unrouted\", \"effort\": null}.\n\nq4: lane prose, effort max, unavailable [\"pellet-2\"]. Lane order: pellet-2 (skipped, R4), atlas-lite (prose in lanes, nw, no pin) → eligible. Effort max above atlas-lite ceiling high → clamp to high. Answer: {\"id\": \"q4\", \"model\": \"atlas-lite\", \"effort\": \"high\"}.\n\nq5: lane extract, effort max. Lane order: corvid-mini (extract in lanes) → eligible. Effort max above ceiling medium → clamp to medium. Answer: {\"id\": \"q5\", \"model\": \"corvid-mini\", \"effort\": \"medium\"}.\n\nq6: lane research, effort high, pinned_cli pl. Lane order: atlas-pro (research in lanes but cli nw ≠ pl → ineligible R3), pellet-2 (research in lanes, cli pl → eligible). Effort high: pellet-2 floor medium, ceiling high → high within range → keep high. Answer: {\"id\": \"q6\", \"model\": \"pellet-2\", \"effort\": \"high\"}.\n\nNow write answers.json in the work directory. Format: [{\"id\": \"...\", \"model\": \"...\", \"effort\": \"...\" or null}, ...]\n\nWrite the file.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_111a95280001rixQmLv8khhRcF","sessionID":"ses_eee5794f1ffe8n4Q5CBZQCgpxn","messageID":"msg_111a92a70001H11hvbu3aGJW2V"}}
